        <headline>yellow warning - wind - in effect</headline>
        <description>
Damaging winds with gusts of 90 to 100 km/h are expected or occurring.

For areas closer to the US border gusts could exceed 110 km/h.

Winds will begin to ease this evening.

###

Please continue to monitor alerts and forecasts issued by Environment Canada. To report severe weather, send an email to ABstorm@ec.gc.ca, call 1-800-239-0484 or post reports on social media using #ABStorm.
</description>
        <instruction>
Secure loose objects. Prepare for possible disruptions to transportation, services, and utilities.
</instruction>
